is shell.\n\nThis is NOT a methodology-design task.\n\nCorrado defined the transform semantics.\nDon/Coda has now ruled the remaining open seams.\n\nImplement exactly those semantics.\n\nDo NOT redesign Parent architecture.\nDo NOT modify the generic synthesis envelope except where required to register the canonical transform.\nDo NOT change Baseline methodology.\nDo NOT change Don Delta methodology.\nDo NOT implement Reanalyze.\nDo NOT invent additional coefficients, weights, interactions, or confidence rules.\n\n==================================================\nCURRENT CERTIFIED STATE\n==================================================\n\nSLICE 1 — BASELINE\nCERTIFIED\n\nSLICE 2 — DON DELTA\nCERTIFIED\n\nSLICE 3 — GENERIC MODEL SYNTHESIS SHELL\nCERTIFIED\n\nCurrent regression state:\n\n114/114 tests green\nlint clean\ntsc -b clean\nVite build clean\n\nExisting NON-CANON transform:\n\ndevpad-transcript-noncanon@0.1.0\n\nmust remain NON-CANON test infrastructure.\n\nIt must NOT be promoted or reused as MLB canon.\n\n==================================================\nCANONICAL TRANSFORM\n==================================================\n\nrule_ref:\n\necq-synthesis-v1\n\nrule_version:\n\n1.0.0\n\nnonCanon:\n\nfalse\n\nPurpose:\n\nApply admissible Don Delta overlays to the certified MLB Baseline fair-probability state using the accepted MLB additive probability-space synthesis rule.\n\n==================================================\nDON/CODA RULINGS — BINDING\n==================================================\n\nRULING A — UNVALIDATED\n\nUNVALIDATED overlays:\n\n- remain explicitly present in lineage\n- remain visible in provenance\n- force synthesized health/status to LOW_CONFIDENCE\n- DO NOT alter the point estimate in ecq-synthesis-v1@1.0.0\n\nTherefore:\n\neffective_numeric_delta(UNVALIDATED) = 0.000000\n\nThis is NOT \"missing = zero.\"\n\nThe overlay exists.\nIts numeric effect is intentionally suppressed by rule because it is not validated.\n\nPreserve the distinction in lineage/provenance.\n\nDo NOT invent a confidence coefficient.\n\nDo NOT use 0.5, 0.75, attestation scaling, or any other inferred weight.\n\nA later accepted uncertainty-widening formula would require a new transformation version.\n\nRULING B — VALIDATED\n\nVALIDATED overlay:\n\n- admissible\n- full bounded numeric effect\n- verification_status remains annotation/health information unless a separately accepted rule says otherwise\n\nNo PARTIAL=\"half weight\".\n\nNo UNVERIFIABLE=\"zero weight\".\n\nRULING C — REFUTED / EXPIRED\n\nREFUTED:\n\ninadmissible\n\nEXPIRED:\n\ninadmissible\n\nThe shell should continue to fail loudly for explicitly selected inadmissible overlays.\n\nRULING D — CONFLICTED SAME-VARIABLE DELTAS\n\nIf two or more admissible overlays target the same variable with opposing/conflicting directions:\n\n- classify that variable adjustment set as CONFLICTED\n- exclude the ENTIRE contested variable adjustment set from point-estimate adjustment\n- do NOT net opposing deltas\n- do NOT choose one side\n- do NOT average them\n- do NOT silently drop only one side\n- synthesized result becomes LOW_CONFIDENCE\n- preserve all conflicting overlays in lineage/provenance\n- emit explicit conflict reason\n\neffective adjustment for that conflicted variable:\n\n0.000000\n\nAgain, this is not missing-data zero-fill.\n\nIt is an explicit ruled exclusion of a contested adjustment class.\n\nRULING E — AUTHORITY SCOPE\n\nUse Corrado's grounded MLB synthesis formulas/constants for THIS transform.\n\nDo not treat implementation of this transform as broad promotion of every draft MLB methodology document.\n\nThe canonical authority here is the specific ruled ecq-synthesis-v1@1.0.0 transformation contract.\n\n==================================================\nNUMERIC SEMANTICS\n==================================================\n\nUse FixedDec 6dp.\n\nROUND_HALF_UP where governed.\n\nProbability bounds:\n\n0.050000 ≤ p ≤ 0.950000\n\nPer-variable overlay bounds:\n\npitcher / era_season\n[-0.030000, +0.030000]\n\nlineup / team_ops_avg\n[-0.030000, +0.030000]\n\nbullpen / bullpen_era_avg\n[-0.030000, +0.030000]\n\nrest / days_rest\n[-0.020000, +0.020000]\n\ninjury / n_out_key\n[-0.030000, +0.030000]\n\ntotals weather / wind-temp\n[-0.030000, +0.030000]\n\ntotals park\n[-0.020000, +0.020000]\n\ntotals umpire\n[-0.010000, +0.010000]\n\nTotal Don overlay cap:\n\nM_delta ∈ [-0.100000, +0.100000]\n\nRun Line uses only its accepted active-family set.\nDo not enable disabled weather/park/umpire semantics there.\n\n==================================================\nCORE FORMULA\n==================================================\n\nFor each admissible variable v:\n\n1. Consider only VALIDATED numeric overlays for point-estimate effect.\n\n2. UNVALIDATED overlays:\n   effect = 0\n   lineage preserved\n   health → LOW_CONFIDENCE\n\n3. If VALIDATED overlays on v conflict in direction:\n   variable effect = 0\n   conflict preserved\n   health → LOW_CONFIDENCE\n\n4. Otherwise same-direction VALIDATED deltas on v:\n\ndelta_v =\nclamp(\n    sum(validated same-direction deltas on v),\n    variable_min,\n    variable_max\n)\n\nThen:\n\nM_delta =\nclamp(\n    Σ delta_v,\n    -0.100000,\n    +0.100000\n)\n\nSynthesized probability:\n\np_synth(selection) =\nclamp(\n    p_baseline(selection) + M_delta,\n    0.050000,\n    0.950000\n)\n\nOpponent complement:\n\np_synth(opponent) =\n1.000000 - p_synth(selection)\n\nComplement must remain conserved after final rounding discipline.\n\n==================================================\nINTERACTIONS\n==================================================\n\nINTERACTION TERMS:\n\nNONE\n\nDo not create interaction coefficients.\n\nDo not multiply component adjustments.\n\nDo not compound sequential deltas.\n\nEvery overlay is evaluated against the same Baseline reference state.\n\n==================================================\nWEIGHTS\n==================================================\n\nThere is NO synthesis weight set in v1.0.0.\n\nEach admissible VALIDATED delta enters at weight 1.0 subject to:\n\n- its declared bounds\n- variable bound\n- total bound\n- conflict exclusion\n\nDo NOT reuse reliability weights as synthesis weights.\n\nDATA PRIORITY != MODEL WEIGHT.\n\n==================================================\nVERIFICATION STATUS\n==================================================\n\nCanonical verification_status:\n\nFULL\nPARTIAL\nUNVERIFIABLE\n\nFor v1.0.0:\n\nverification_status does NOT numerically scale the delta.\n\nIt remains:\n\n- provenance\n- health/quality annotation\n- audit state\n\nDo not invent numeric coercion.\n\n==================================================\nMISSING / PROXY\n==================================================\n\nMISSING != ZERO.\n\nIf a targeted Baseline variable is not MEASURED / unavailable:\n\n- do not manufacture a numeric baseline quantity\n- do not apply that Don Delta numerically\n- preserve overlay lineage\n- degrade health to LOW_CONFIDENCE\n- emit explicit reason\n\nPROXY != DIRECT.\n\nDo not silently promote PROXY evidence to DIRECT.\n\nRespect the module's admissibility/evidence-class requirements.\n\n==================================================\nTEMPORAL SEMANTICS\n==================================================\n\nAt synthesis knowledge time T:\n\nOnly consume state known by T.\n\nNo later:\n\n- human input\n- classification\n- validation\n- refutation\n- expiry\n- evidence\n\nmay enter replay at T.\n\nA later REFUTED/EXPIRED state must not retroactively alter an earlier valid synthesis.\n\nUse existing certified anti-lookahead machinery.\n\n==================================================\nMULTI-DELTA ORDERING\n==================================================\n\nDeterministic ordering:\n\nsort overlays by don_delta_id for canonical identity/input ordering.\n\nMath is additive/commutative after ruled conflict classification.\n\nDo not make result depend on iteration order.\n\n