nformation, and proxy/direct state.\n\nTurning the existing Don Delta record itself into a numeric model record would blur two layers we have worked hard to keep separate.\n\nInstead, introduce a new immutable artifact, conceptually something like:\n\n`SynthesisOverlayValueSet`\n\nIt would be **derived from an exact Don Delta + exact Baseline + sport-module rule**, and would carry only the value surface needed for execution.\n\nFor example, the sport-owned materialization can expose:\n\n- `variable_id`\n- `magnitude_micro`\n- `lane`\n- `baseline_measured`\n- `evidence_class`\n- `proxy/direct`\n- legal bounds\n- validation state\n- verification status\n- originating `don_delta_id`\n- originating human-input IDs\n- exact Baseline ID/hash\n- `as_of_knowledge_time`\n- sport-module version\n- value-materialization rule/version\n- deterministic hash/identity\n\nThen the Parent synthesis shell passes that **already-certified value object** to `ecq-synthesis-v1`.\n\nThe transform still fetches nothing.\n\n## Authority split\n\n**Corrado** must define how human Don Delta information becomes that numerical sport value surface. That includes exactly where `magnitudeMicro` comes from and whether every Don-input category can even produce one.\n\n**Coda/Don** decide and freeze that contract.\n\n**Chiave** then checks the bounded interface amendment, not the MLB math.\n\n**Nico** implements it.\n\n**Luce** independently verifies it.\n\nOnly after that do we register canonical `ecq-synthesis-v1@1.0.0`.\n\n### Versioning consequence\n\nI would **not mutate any existing certified envelope in place**.\n\nThe existing Baseline, Don Delta v2, and Model Synthesis shell remain valid.\n\nThe new artifact gets its **own envelope/version identity**. If the generic synthesis input contract must add this value reference/payload, that contract receives a bounded version amendment as well.\n\nThat gives us:\n\n**Human state remains human state. Quant value state becomes quant value state. Synthesis consumes certified quant values.**\n\nThat is much cleaner than turning `DonDelta` into a catch-all object.\n\n## Don decision\n\nMy recommendation is therefore:\n\n**OPTION 2 — APPROVE FOR DESIGN**, with the constraint that the new value surface is a separate immutable, lineage-bound materialization between Don Delta and Model Synthesis.\n\nDo **not** authorize Nico to implement fields yet. **Corrado is next**, because the missing piece is semantic: *how does a validated human input become a numeric MLB delta?*\n\n- [ ] **COPY THIS PROMPT**\n\n```text\nCORRADO — EC8 EDGE CREW QUANT\nDEFINE DON-DELTA → SYNTHESIS VALUE MATERIALIZATION\n\nSEAT\nCorrado — Quant Engine / Quantitative Semantics\n\nMODE\nSEMANTIC DEFINITION ONLY\n\nDO NOT IMPLEMENT.\nDO NOT MODIFY PARENT ARCHITECTURE.\nDO NOT MODIFY REACT / LEDGER / API.\n\nCONTEXT\n\nChiave refused canonical ecq-synthesis-v1 registration because the currently certified state does not contain the numerical value surface the transform requires.\n\nCurrent certified Don Delta contains:\n\n- human input\n- classification\n- validation\n- verification\n- provenance\n- temporal state\n- lineage\n\nIt does NOT contain the executable MLB synthesis values required by the verified math core, including:\n\n- magnitudeMicro\n- baselineMeasured\n- proxy/direct state per quantitative overlay\n\nThe Parent SynthesisOverlayInput is references-only by design.\n\nThe transform is forbidden from fetching those values itself.\n\nDon/Coda forward ruling:\n\nDO NOT overload the existing Don Delta record.\n\nDefine a NEW immutable sport-owned value materialization between:\n\nDON DELTA\n→ SYNTHESIS OVERLAY VALUE MATERIALIZATION\n→ MODEL SYNTHESIS\n\nMISSION\n\nDefine exactly how an accepted MLB Don Delta produces zero, one, or more executable synthesis overlay values.\n\nThe output must be precise enough for Coda/Don to freeze the contract and Nico to implement it without inventing quantitative semantics.\n\n==================================================\n1. MATERIALIZATION PURPOSE\n==================================================\n\nDefine the purpose and authority of the new value artifact.\n\nIt must:\n\n- reference an exact Baseline\n- reference an exact Don Delta\n- preserve originating human-input lineage\n- contain the exact numerical values required by ecq-synthesis-v1\n- be deterministic\n- be immutable\n- be time-bounded\n- contain no hidden fetch behavior\n\n==================================================\n2. REQUIRED VALUE FIELDS\n==================================================\n\nDetermine exact semantics for at least:\n\nvariable_id\n\nlane\n\nmagnitude_micro\n\nlower_bound_micro\n\nupper_bound_micro\n\nbaseline_measured\n\nevidence_class\n\nproxy/direct state\n\nvalidation_state\n\nverification_status\n\nas_of_knowledge_time\n\noriginating Don Delta id/hash\n\noriginating human input ids\n\nBaseline id/hash\n\nsport module id/version\n\nvalue-materialization rule id/version\n\nDo not accept this list blindly.\n\nAdd/remove fields based on actual quantitative necessity.\n\n==================================================\n3. CRITICAL QUESTION — MAGNITUDE SOURCE\n==================================================\n\nDefine exactly where magnitude_micro comes from.\n\nFor each Don Delta input category:\n\nFACTUAL / NEWS\nEMOTIONAL / MOTIVATIONAL\nHEARSAY / SOCIAL\nOBSERVATIONAL\nMATCHUP / TACTICAL\nSITUATIONAL / CONTEXT\nMARKET\nGUT / INTUITION\n\nstate whether it may produce:\n\nNUMERIC OVERLAY\nNON-NUMERIC ONLY\nCONDITIONALLY NUMERIC\n\nIf numeric, define the exact conversion rule.\n\nDo NOT invent a magnitude merely because synthesis requires one.\n\nIf current authority does not define conversion for a category, return:\n\nUNDEFINED IN CURRENT AUTHORITY\n\n==================================================\n4. VARIABLE TARGETING\n==================================================\n\nDefine how a Don input maps to a canonical MLB synthesis variable:\n\nera_season\nteam_op